  "term": "tragedy of the commons",
  "definition": "Tragedy of the commons is a social outcome in which cheating on a shared cooperative system benefits noncontributors in the short term but ultimately harms the whole group. In the source packet, it refers to a well-mixed population where individuals avoid the cost of producing a shared benefit, leading to population-level collapse.",
